<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/notation_0bfde80a83">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNotation"/>
	<rdf:value>1</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2020-06-15</created>
	<startDate xmlns="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2020-06-24</startDate>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_40c3a1d5f5">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="cs">Základní všeobecné znalosti základní dovednosti požadované k provádění jednoduchých úkolů pracovat nebo studovat pod přímým dohledem ve strukturovaném prostředí.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_35f00d7213">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="hr">Osnovno opće znanje, osnovne vještine potrebne za obavljanje jednostavnih zadataka, studiranje ili rad pod izravnim nadzorom u strukturiranom kontekstu.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_21192c4d42">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="lv">Vispārīgas pamatzināšanas; pamatprasmes, kas nepieciešamas vienkāršu uzdevumu veikšanai – darbs vai mācības tiešā uzraudzībā strukturētā vidē.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_15e64a377d">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="lt">Pagrindinės bendrosios žinios Elementarūs įgūdžiai, reikalingi paprastoms užduotims atlikti Dirbti ar mokytis struktūrizuotame kontekste, tiesiogiai prižiūrint kitam asmeniui.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_625c4845e6">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="en">basic general knowledge basic skills required to carry out simple tasks work or study under direct supervision in a structured context</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_c797d0559c">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="pt">Conhecimentos gerais básicos competências básicas necessárias à realização de tarefas simples trabalhar ou estudar sob supervisão direta num contexto estruturado.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_e92885d880">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="da">Grundlæggende generel viden, grundlæggende færdigheder, der er nødvendige for at udføre enkle opgaver, arbejde eller studere under direkte tilsyn i en struktureret sammenhæng.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_52d748af51">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="ga">Buneolas ginearálta na bunscileanna is gá chun tascanna simplí, obair nó staidéar a dhéanamh faoi mhaoirseacht dhíreach i gcomhthéacs struchtúrtha.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_d7d248c276">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="fi">Yleistiedot yksinkertaisten tehtävien suorittamiseksi vaadittavat perustaidot työskentely tai opiskelu selkeässä toimintaympäristössä suoran valvonnan alaisena.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_6736ca4401">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="de">Grundlegendes Allgemeinwissen Grundlegende Fertigkeiten, die zur Erledigung einfacher Aufgaben erforderlich sind Arbeiten oder Lernen unter direkter Anleitung in einem strukturierten Kontext.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_c263fd5eea">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="es">Conocimientos generales básicos Capacidades básicas necesarias para efectuar tareas simples Trabajo o estudio bajo supervisión directa en un contexto estructurado.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_a0ef46f536">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="tr">Temel genel bilgi basit görevleri yerine getirmek için gerekli temel beceriye sahip olma yapılandırılmış bir ortamda rehberlik ve gözetim altında basit görevleri yerine getirme veya öğrenme.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_c76089800d">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="it">Conoscenze generali di base competenze di base necessarie per svolgere compiti semplici lavorare o studiare sotto supervisione diretta in un contesto strutturato.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_4e72d0eff1">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="sl">Osnovno splošno znanje osnovne spretnosti, potrebne za izvedbo preprostih nalog delo ali študij pod neposrednim nadzorom v strukturiranem okviru.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_c8bfa346c1">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="pl">Podstawowa wiedza ogólna podstawowe umiejętności potrzebne do realizacji prostych zadań praca lub nauka pod bezpośrednim nadzorem w zorganizowanym kontekście.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_a3b4ace40e">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="el">Βασικές γενικές γνώσεις βασικές δεξιότητες που απαιτούνται για την εκτέλεση απλών καθηκόντων εργασία ή σπουδές υπό άμεση εποπτεία σε δομημένο πλαίσιο.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_0a9ce82414">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="et">Üldteadmised ja põhioskused lihtsamate (töö)ülesannete täitmiseks, suudab töötada või õppida otsesel juhendamisel piiritletud olukorras.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_ca489e9ee1">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="en">&lt;html:div xmlns:html="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" class="Knowledge"&gt;basic general knowledge&lt;/html:div&gt;
          &lt;html:div xmlns:html="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" class="Skill"&gt;basic skills required to carry out simple tasks&lt;/html:div&gt;
          &lt;html:div xmlns:html="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" class="Competence"&gt;work or study under direct supervision in a structured context&lt;/html:div&gt;</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2020-06-15</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_14ac470784">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="mt">Għarfien ġenerali bażiku ħiliet bażiċi meħtieġa għat-twettiq ta’ kompiti sempliċi xogħol jew studju taħt superviżjoni diretta f’kuntest strutturat.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_e5f8e14e1a">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="hu">Általános alapismeretek, olyan alapkészségek, amelyek egyszerű feladatok elvégzéséhez, közvetlen felügyelet mellett, strukturált keretek között történő munkavégzéshez vagy tanuláshoz szükségesek.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_f16dd3c279">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="sk">Základné všeobecné vedomosti základné zručnosti potrebné na vykonávanie jednoduchých úloh pracovať alebo študovať pod priamym dohľadom v štruktúrovanom prostredí.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_edf8ff51b7">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="bg">Основни общи знания основни умения, необходими за изпълнение на прости задачи работа или обучение под пряко наблюдение в структуриран контекст.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_a7733e02c0">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="is">Grunnfærni í almennri þekkingu sem nauðsynleg er til að framkvæma einföld verkefni í vinnu eða námi undir leiðsögn í skipulögðu samhengi.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_904120c89d">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="sv">Grundläggande allmän kunskap Grundläggande färdigheter för att utföra enkla uppgifter Arbetar eller studerar under direkt övervakning i ett strukturerat sammanhang</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_443761d596">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="it">Conoscenze complete, specialistiche, fattuali e teoriche in un ambito di lavoro o di studio e consapevolezza dei limiti di tali conoscenze una gamma completa di competenze cognitive e pratiche necessarie per sviluppare soluzioni creative a problemi astratti esercitare la gestione e la supervisione in contesti di attività di lavoro o di studio in cui vi è un cambiamento imprevedibile - rivedere e sviluppare le prestazioni di se stesso e degli altri.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_223507bd38">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="el">Πραγματολογικές και θεωρητικές γνώσεις ευρύτερων εννοιών σε πεδίο εργασίας ή σπουδών φάσμα γνωστικών και πρακτικών δεξιοτήτων που απαιτούνται για την εξεύρεση λύσεων σε συγκεκριμένα προβλήματα σε πεδίο εργασίας ή σπουδών αυτοδιαχείριση βάσει οδηγιών στο πλαίσιο εργασίας ή σπουδών, το οποίο είναι συνήθως προβλέψιμο αλλά μπορεί να υποστεί αλλαγές εποπτεία της συνήθους εργασίας άλλων, αναλαμβάνοντας κάποια ευθύνη για την αξιολόγηση και τη βελτίωση των δραστηριοτήτων εργασίας ή σπουδών.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/note_07c5b846c9">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
	<rdf:value xml:lang="lv">Padziļinātas zināšanas konkrētā darba vai studiju jomā, kas ietver teoriju un principu kritisku izpratni – padziļinātas prasmes, kas demonstrē meistarību un spēju ieviest jauninājumus, kas nepieciešamas, lai risinātu sarežģītas un neparedzamas problēmas specializētā darba vai studiju jomā – spēja vadīt sarežģītas tehniskas vai profesionālas darbības vai projektus, uzņemoties lēmumu pieņemšanas atbildību neparedzamos darba vai studiju kontekstos – spēja uzņemties atbildību par indivīdu un grupu profesionālās attīstības vadību.</rdf:value>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-16</created>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/eqf/label_00625d110a">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2008/05/skos-xl#Label"/>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-09-17</created>
